  "description": "***EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY***\n\nBohan Hyland & Associates are delighted to present this 3 bedroom home in Brabazon Links, Golf Links Road, Bettystown to the rental market. This well-presented and fully furnished home offers bright, comfortable accommodation in the popular Brabazon Links development.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room with feature fireplace and access to the rear garden, a fitted kitchen/dining area with a range of appliances, guest WC, three bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property also benefits from gas-fired central heating and is presented in good condition throughout.\n\nBrabazon Links is ideally situated just off Golf Links Road, within easy reach of Bettystown Village and Bettystown Beach, with a wide range of local shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and recreational amenities nearby. The property is also well positioned for access to Drogheda, Laytown Train Station and the M1 motorway, making it an excellent location for commuters.\n\n***EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY***",
